message: "Please cite this dataset using the following information."
title: "TRACE-V2: Multidimensional Artistic Career Trajectories — Datasets"
authors:
  - family-names: "Leao"
    given-names: "Simone Zarpelon"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  This repository contains the original simulation output and processed
  artist-level analytical dataset from Simulation 1 of TRACE-V2
  (Trajectory Reconstruction through Agent-based Cultural Emergence).
  The materials support analysis of artistic career trajectories across
  four separate dimensions: economic capital, symbolic capital,
  secondary employment, and exits. TRACE-V2 is an exploratory
  agent-based model; the datasets are simulated rather than observations
  of real artists.
